ia","image_path":"/bScM0AHRktwfMxmt7lP6IjV7KPR.jpg","director":"Pedro Almodóvar"}},{"type":"person","id":6193,"image_path":"/wo2hJpn04vbtmh0B9utCFdsQhxM.jpg","name":"Leonardo DiCaprio","winner":false,"movie":{"type":"movie","id":466272,"name":"Había una vez en Hollywood","image_path":"/gMEKjlq4JcLR93oAVSD47MSeO9h.jpg","director":"Quentin Tarantino","winner":false}},{"type":"person","id":1023139,"image_path":"/fsbGQ1eZFgdsG1XnKlhNSvHsiGo.jpg","name":"Adam Driver","winner":false,"movie":{"type":"movie","id":492188,"name":"Historia de un matrimonio","image_path":"/LaZ5rwaMvVH20J8O2Nu9uuXGI5.jpg","director":"Noah Baumbach","winner":false}},{"type":"person","id":378,"image_path":"/zwSv5uXzPTtmitFe39UdqnVwmdL.jpg","name":"Jonathan Price","winner":false,"movie":{"type":"movie","id":551332,"name":"Los Dos Papas","image_path":"/oOjACi3zgscAFmgzJhNe3aZVhaW.jpg","director":"Fernando Meirelles"}}]},{"type":"awards_nominees","name":"Mejor Actriz","nominee_list":[{"type":"person","id":9137,"image_path":"/6aSRq8LBE7FULueg9K5JEA3GLTy.jpg","name":"Renée Zellweger","winner":true,"movie":{"type":"movie","id":491283,"name":"Judy","image_path":"/bbS0KWxQPMTiQ53WooVgCIgEWnc.jpg","director":"Rupert Goold"}},{"type":"person","id":1765068,"image_path":"/vWLhplaio80fuv5mACLImjstg2v.jpg","name":"Cynthia Erivo","winner":false,"movie":{"type":"movie","id":506528,"name":"Harriet, en busca de la libertad","image_path":"/wFfn2PISJ8u4Ui45kIY6vASEHjq.jpg","director":"Kasi Lemmons"}},{"type":"person","id":6885,"image_path":"/gd7ShD0yt4bsR2STeQ19KQ6hvXL.jpg","name":"Charlize Theron","winner":false,"movie":{"type":"movie","id":525661,"name":"El escándalo","image_path":"/s7DTu2TAOzIcunFtFyqzyYoICiy.jpg","director":"Jay Roach"}},{"type":"person","id":1245,"image_path":"/6NsMbJXRlDZuDzatN2akFdGuTvx.jpg","name":"Scarlett Johansson","winner":false,"movie":{"type":"movie","id":492188,"name":"Historia de un matrimonio","image_path":"/LaZ5rwaMvVH20J8O2Nu9uuXGI5.jpg","director":"Noah Baumbach","winner":false}},{"type":"person","id":36592,"image_path":"/4plcgNpHArZUTiYqgpQdGw4PZdT.jpg","name":"Saoirse Ronan","winner":false,"movie":{"type":"movie","id":331482,"name":"Mujercitas","image_path":"/oXRJlVPJO8GqPPpJwbomQEpAi3N.jpg","director":"Greta Gerwig","winner":false}}]},{"type":"awards_nominees","name":"Mejor Actor de Reparto","nominee_list":[{"type":"person","id":287,"image_path":"/cckcYc2v0yh1tc9QjRelptcOBko.jpg","name":"Brad Pitt","winner":true,"movie":{"type":"movie","id":466272,"name":"Había una vez en Hollywood","image_path":"/gMEKjlq4JcLR93oAVSD47MSeO9h.jpg","director":"Quentin Tarantino","winner":false}},{"type":"person","id":31,"image_path":"/tAyAXPLnR9Sgi7x2lMV4PUPitai.jpg","name":"Tom Hanks","winner":false,"movie":{"type":"movie","id":501907,"name":"Un buen día en el vecindario","image_path":"/qenbW0aWvW8bxNb0XVDPeIUwFVu.jpg","director":"Marielle Heller","winner":true}},{"type":"person","id":4517,"image_path":"/iX8b8KL8cezzxw1FnH978h9ob48.jpg","name":"Joe Pesci","winner":false,"movie":{"type":"movie","id":398978,"name":"El irlandés","image_path":"/mFyQRQoUh8InlwmE5fRd9LOBRZ1.jpg","director":"Martin Scorsese","winner":false}},{"type":"person","id":1158,"image_path":"/fMDFeVf0pjopTJbyRSLFwNDm8Wr.jpg","name":"Al Pacino","winner":false,"movie":{"type":"movie","id":398978,"name":"El irlandés","image_path":"/mFyQRQoUh8InlwmE5fRd9LOBRZ1.jpg","director":"Martin Scorsese","winner":false}},{"type":"person","id":4173,"image_path":"/9ukJS2QWTJ22HcwR1ktMmoJ6RSL.jpg","name":"Anthony Hopkins","winner":false,"movie":{"type":"movie","id":551332,"name":"Los Dos Papas","image_path":"/oOjACi3zgscAFmgzJhNe3aZVhaW.jpg","director":"Fernando Meirelles"}}]},{"type":"block_special","title":"Recepción","description":"Se estima que 23,6 millones de espectadores vieron la ceremonia en vivo, con una calificación de 5,3 en el grupo demográfico principal. Esto representó una caída del 20 % con respecto a la ceremonia del año anterior, lo que la convirtió en la ceremonia de los Óscar menos vista de todos los tiempos. Aun así, la ceremonia fue clasificada como el programa de premios más visto de la temporada televisiva 2019-2020 en Estados Unidos, ya que la disminución de la audiencia es un fenómeno observado en todos los programas de premios en los últimos años. Los Óscar 2020 también son uno de los últimos programas en vivo que se emitieron en Estados Unidos en medio de la alteración del calendario general de espectáculos debido a la pandemia de COVID-19."},{"type":"awards_nominees","name":"Mejor Actriz de Reparto","nominee_list":[{"type":"person","id":4784,"image_path":"/2Ryt0SsExqWrLTzBu6sZcbLwoDJ.jpg","name":"Laura Dern","winner":true,"movie":{"type":"movie","id":492188,"name":"Historia de un matrimonio","image_path":"/LaZ5rwaMvVH20J8O2Nu9uuXGI5.jpg","director":"Noah Baumbach","winner":false}},{"type":"person","id":8534,"image_path":"/3MsayDvY73uXGVbCFHyy1ABTacV.jpg","name":"Kathy Bates","winner":false,"movie":{"type":"movie","id":292011,"name":"El caso de Richard Jewell","image_path":"/koGknmSPrlDxzb5hvqn7CT5Uqt.jpg","director":"Clint Eastwood","winner":false}},{"type":"person","id":1373737,"image_path":"/75PvULemW8BvheSKtPMoBBsvPLh.jpg","name":"Florence Pugh","winner":false,"movie":{"type":"movie","id":331482,"name":"Mujercitas","image_path":"/oXRJlVPJO8GqPPpJwbomQEpAi3N.jpg","director":"Greta Gerwig","winner":false}},{"type":"person","id":234352,"image_path":"/ecv9SBN9m1cEZFfSopph6wf8fk.jpg","name":"Margot Robbie","winner":false,"movie":{"type":"movie","id":525661,"name":"El escándalo","image_path":"/s7DTu2TAOzIcunFtFyqzyYoICiy.jpg","director":"Jay Roach"}},{"type":"person","id":1245,"image_path":"/6NsMbJXRlDZuDzatN2akFdGuTvx.jpg","name":"Scarlett Johansson","winner":false,"movie":{"type":"movie","id":515001,"name":"Jojo Rabbit","image_path":"/vC7gB8h8KFTsraAoKsj0haHAljR.jpg","director":"Taika Waititi","winner":false}}]},{"type":"awards_nominees","name":"Mejor Película de Animación","nominee_list":[{"type":"movie","id":301528,"name":"Toy Story 4","image_path":"/AkrRD3Lnwb82Stu2SpDKAerK6O2.jpg","director":"Josh Cooley","winner":true},{"type":"movie","id":166428,"name":"Cómo Entrenar A Tu Dragón 3","image_path":"/5uqxMHM7YLKk6yni4bOE0D6DVz8.jpg","director":"Dean DeBlois","winner":false},{"type":"movie","id":586940,"name":"Perdí mi cuerpo","image_path":"/jH0mknMEByXUDTfiS1SQOxYDL5z.jpg","director":"Jérémy Clapin","winner":false},{"type":"movie","id":508965,"name":"La leyenda de Klaus","image_path":"/aLniylyJlbXEdxvaGSuQkRACWUx.jpg","director":"Sergio Pablos","winner":false},{"type":"movie","id":458253,"name":"Sr. Link","image_path":"/f4yoHMsJsCt9UNmxa6LR3Vjl2z4.jpg","director":"Chris Butler","winner":false}]},{"type":"video","video_id":"ekMl5VHBH4I","information":{"contentTitle":"Bong Joon Ho wins Best Director","contentText":"Al aceptar el premio a Mejor Director, Bong Joon-ho habló a través de su intérprete: \"Cuando era joven y estudiaba cine, había una frase que grabé profundamente en mi corazón: lo más personal es lo más creativo\". Luego dijo en inglés que esa cita provenía de \"nuestro gran Martin Scorsese\", lo que llevó al público a brindarle a Scorsese una ovación entusiasta. Más tarde, Bong confirmó en una conferencia de prensa ante la prensa surcoreana que había leído la cita en un libro escrito por David Thompson; Bong no mencionó el título del libro en ese momento, pero resultó ser Scorsese on Scorsese, coescrito por Thompson e Ian Christie.","source":"YouTube: Canal <i>MrHampiano</i>"}},{"type":"awards_nominees","name":"Mejor Fotografía","nominee_list":[{"type":"movie","id":530915,"name":"1917","image_path":"/8KkyXE7Hd9MPOOkORxkMM6SUXAB.jpg","director":"Sam Mendes","winner":true},{"type":"movie","id":466272,"name":"Había una vez en Hollywood","image_path":"/gMEKjlq4JcLR93oAVSD47MSeO9h.jpg","director":"Quentin Tarantino","winner":false},{"type":"movie","id":398978,"name":"El irlandés","image_path":"/mFyQRQoUh8InlwmE5fRd9LOBRZ1.jpg","director":"Martin Scorsese","winner":false},{"type":"movie","id":475557,"name":"Guasón","image_path":"/xLxgVxFWvb9hhUyCDDXxRPPnFck.jpg","director":"Todd Phillips","winner":false},{"type":"movie","id":466272,"name":"Había una vez en Hollywood","image_path":"/gMEKjlq4JcLR93oAVSD47MSeO9h.jpg","director":"Quentin Tarantino","winner":false}]},{"type":"awards_nominees","name":"Mejor Dirección","nominee_list":[{"type":"person","id":21684,"image_path":"/tKLJBqbdH6HFj2QxLA5o8Zk7IVs.jpg","name":"Bong Joon-ho","winner":true,"movie":{"type":"movie","id":496243,"name":"Parásitos","image_path":"/igw938inb6Fy0YVcwIyxQ7Lu5FO.jpg","director":"Bong Joon-ho","winner":true}},{"type":"person","id":1032,"image_path":"/9U9Y5GQuWX3EZy39B8nkk4NY01S.jpg","name":"Martin Scorsese","winner":false,"movie":{"type":"movie","id":398978,"name":"El irlandés","image_path":"/mFyQRQoUh8InlwmE5fRd9LOBRZ1.jpg","director":"Martin Scorsese","winner":false}},{"type":"person","id":57130,"image_path":"/A6FPht87DiqXzp456WjakLi2AtP.jpg","name":"Todd Phillips","winner":false,"movie":{"type":"movie","id":475557,"name":"Guasón","image_path":"/xLxgVxFWvb9hhUyCDDXxRPPnFck.jpg","director":"Todd Phillips","winner":false}},{"type":"person","id":45400,"image_path":"/3H0xzU12GTNJyQTpGysEuI9KyiQ.jpg","name":"Greta Gerwig","winner":false,"movie":{"type":"movie","id":331482,"name":"Mujercitas","image_path":"/oXRJlVPJO8GqPPpJwbomQEpAi3N.jpg","director":"Greta Gerwig","winner":false}},{"type":"person","id":39,"image_path":"/5z89X9rB76JDblqMQ52fviwXxAN.jpg","name":"Sam Mendes","winner":false,"movie":{"type":"movie","id":530915,"name":"1917","image_path":"/8KkyXE7Hd9MPOOkORxkMM6SUXAB.jpg","director":"Sam Mendes","winner":false}}]},{"type":"awards_nominees","name":"Mejor Vestuario","nominee_list":[{"type":"movie","id":331482,"name":"Mujercitas","image_path":"/oXRJlVPJO8GqPPpJwbomQEpAi3N.jpg","director":"Greta Gerwig","winner":true},{"type":"movie","id":398978,"name":"El irlandés","image_path":"/mFyQRQoUh8InlwmE5fRd9LOBRZ1.jpg","director":"Martin Scorsese","winner":false},{"type":"movie","id":515001,"name":"Jojo Rabbit","image_path":"/vC7gB8h8KFTsraAoKsj0haHAljR.jpg","director":"Taika Waititi","winner":false},{"type":"movie","id":475557,"name":"Guasón","image_path":"/xLxgVxFWvb9hhUyCDDXxRPPnFck.jpg","director":"Todd Phillips","winner":false},{"type":"movie","id":466272,"name":"Había una vez en Hollywood","image_path":"/gMEKjlq4JcLR93oAVSD47MSeO9h.jpg","director":"Quentin Tarantino","winner":false}]},{"type":"video","video_id":"MqAe7U54ry0","information":{"contentTitle":"James Corden and Rebel Wilson Funny ‘Cats’ Oscars Skit","contentText":"James Corden y Rebel Wilson entregaron el premio a los Mejores Efectos Visuales vestidos con disfraces de gato para satirizar sus papeles principales en Cats, una película muy criticada por sus efectos visuales, entre otros factores, y le dijeron al público: \"Como miembros del elenco de la película Cats, nadie entiende mejor que nosotros la importancia de unos buenos efectos visuales\". Mills dijo que la idea fue de Corden. Al día siguiente, el 10 de febrero de 2020, la Visual Effects Society emitió un comunicado en el que criticaba el número de Corden y Wilson, señalando que \"[los] mejores efectos visuales del mundo no compensarán una historia mal contada\".","source":"YouTube: Canal <i>Oscars</i>"}},{"type":"awards_nominees","name":"Mejor Documental","nominee_list":[{"type":"movie","id":565716,"name":"American Factory","image_path":"/9kLpTYpnbnJWq6IwY6DOyyEDaN3.jpg","director":"Julia Reichert","winner":true},{"type":"movie","id":621729,"name":"The Cave","image_path":"/2Zb8U2EXBv36DGG9jaEESNEeJv9.jpg","director":"Feras Fayyad","winner":false},{"type":"movie","id":566221,"name":"Al filo de la democracia","image_path":"/z2aPe57jyW0TPYLVBXb8T0yBFGQ.jpg","director":"Petra Costa","winner":false},{"type":"movie","id":576017,"name":"Para Sama","image_path":"/w8ZytqAN2B56ejEvIVjubVNL3oo.jpg","director":"Edward Watts","winner":false},{"type":"movie","id":566213,"name":"Honeyland","image_path":"/6JfuTYYMB2Af6Iw5cEmpIOx5OSW.jpg","director":"Tamara Kotevska","winner":false}]},{"type":"awards_nominees","name":"Mejor Cortometraje Documental","nominee_list":[{"type":"movie","id":612074,"name":"Learning to Skateboard in a Warzone (If You're a Girl)","image_path":"/c5F2SBvq7MOYlkoaI5mmlb5V5ka.jpg","director":"Carol Dysinger","winner":true},{"type":"movie","id":592303,"name":"In the absence","image_path":"/7VQ6eu8U7Dp8FaD71USIxk9yQ4Y.jpg","director":"Yi Seung-jun","winner":false},{"type":"movie","id":593280,"name":"La vida me supera","image_path":"/fHO4wOw7u6B9yIzLuKf0UBO7GmO.jpg","director":"Kristine Samuelson","winner":false},{"type":"movie","id":634767,"name":"St. Louis Superman","image_path":"/","director":"Smriti Mundhra","winner":false},{"type":"movie","id":634767,"name":"St. Louis Superman","image_path":"/qV4eTXHQSumCDbJzEJizoBFR6Pe.jpg","director":"","winner":false}]},{"type":"awards_nominees","name":"Mejor Montaje","nominee_list":[{"type":"movie","id":359724,"name":"Contra lo imposible","image_path":"/4hQD9xGJOh7e0h3Md6BB8oxtPQS.jpg","director":"James Mangold","winner":true},{"type":"movie","id":398978,"name":"El irlandés","image_path":"/mFyQRQoUh8InlwmE5fRd9LOBRZ1.jpg","director":"Martin Scorsese","winner":false},{"type":"movie","id":515001,"name":"Jojo Rabbit","image_path":"/vC7gB8h8KFTsraAoKsj0haHAljR.jpg","director":"Taika Waititi","winner":false},{"type":"movie","id":475557,"name":"Guasón","image_path":"/xLxgVxFWvb9hhUyCDDXxRPPnFck.jpg","director":"Todd Phillips","winner":false},{"type":"movie","id":496243,"name":"Parásitos","image_path":"/igw938inb6Fy0YVcwIyxQ7Lu5FO.jpg","director":"Bong Joon-ho","winner":false}]},{"type":"block_special","title":"Ceremonia","description":"Durante su reunión de junta directiva de abril de 2019, la Academia votó cambiar el nombre de la categoría \"Óscar a la mejor película en lengua extranjera\" por \"Óscar a la mejor película internacional\". Las películas de animación y los documentales también podrían optar al premio renombrado, pero se mantendrían los demás criterios, que exigen que las candidatas tengan la mayor parte de sus diálogos en un idioma distinto del inglés. La categoría del Óscar al mejor maquillaje y peinado se amplió de siete finalistas y tres nominados a diez finalistas y cinco nominados.<br/><br/>\n\nEl 9 de enero de 2020, la presidenta de ABC Entertainment, Karey Burke, reveló que por segunda vez consecutiva la ceremonia no tendría conductor, citando el éxito del formato en la ceremonia anterior (cuando el comediante Kevin Hart se retiró del puesto). Burke prometió que la ceremonia sería una muestra de \"grandes valores de entretenimiento, grandes números musicales, comedia y poder de las estrellas\"."},{"type":"awards_nominees","name":"Mejor Película Internacional","nominee_list":[{"type":"movie","id":496243,"name":"Parásitos","image_path":"/igw938inb6Fy0YVcwIyxQ7Lu5FO.jpg","director":"Bong Joon-ho","winner":true},{"type":"movie","id":519010,"name":"Dolor y gloria","image_path":"/bScM0AHRktwfMxmt7lP6IjV7KPR.jpg","director":"Pedro Almodóvar","winner":false},{"type":"movie","id":586863,"name":"Los miserables","image_path":"/ywO4oyCfohDvrbU7motFRd2WdqL.jpg","director":"Ladj Ly","winner":false},{"type":"movie","id":566213,"name":"Honeyland","image_path":"/6JfuTYYMB2Af6Iw5cEmpIOx5OSW.jpg","director":"Tamara Kotevska","winner":false},{"type":"movie","id":471707,"name":"Corpus Christi","image_path":"/94l5tagsFM2x8SFa0ANtUrcB5Il.jpg","director":"Jan Komasa","winner":false}]},{"type":"awards_nominees","name":"Mejor Maquillaje y Peinado","nominee_list":[{"type":"movie","id":525661,"name":"El escándalo","image_path":"/s7DTu2TAOzIcunFtFyqzyYoICiy.jpg","director":"Jay Roach","winner":true},{"type":"movie","id":475557,"name":"Guasón","image_path":"/xLxgVxFWvb9hhUyCDDXxRPPnFck.jpg","director":"Todd Phillips","winner":false},{"type":"movie","id":530915,"name":"1917","image_path":"/8KkyXE7Hd9MPOOkORxkMM6SUXAB.jpg","director":"Sam Mendes","winner":false},{"type":"movie","id":491283,"name":"Judy","image_path":"/bbS0KWxQPMTiQ53WooVgCIgEWnc.jpg","director":"Rupert Goold","winner":false},{"type":"movie","id":420809,"name":"Maléfica 2: La Dueña del Mal","image_path":"/oP3TasnCKqSvGDv0sHLUhpioNVb.jpg","director":"Joachim Rønning","winner":false}]},{"type":"awards_nominees","name":"Mejor Banda Sonora Original","nominee_list":[{"type":"movie","id":475557,"name":"Guasón","image_path":"/xLxgVxFWvb9hhUyCDDXxRPPnFck.jpg","director":"Todd Phillips","winner":true},{"type":"movie","id":331482,"name":"Mujercitas","image_path":"/oXRJlVPJO8GqPPpJwbomQEpAi3N.jpg","director":"Greta Gerwig","winner":false},{"type":"movie","id":492188,"name":"Historia de un matrimonio","image_path":"/LaZ5rwaMvVH20J8O2Nu9uuXGI5.jpg","director":"Noah Baumbach","winner":false},{"type":"movie","id":530915,"name":"1917","image_path":"/8KkyXE7Hd9MPOOkORxkMM6SUXAB.jpg","director":"Sam Mendes","winner":false},{"type":"movie","id":181812,"name":"Star Wars: El ascenso de Skywalker","image_path":"/lFx2i2pg1BoaD7grcpGDyHM1eML.jpg","director":"J.J. Abrams","winner":false}]},{"type":"video","video_id":"Nhe-LJLZMHk","information":{"contentTitle":"Eminem - Lose Yourself Live at the 2020 Oscars","contentText":"Uno de los momentos destacados de la ceremonia fue la actuación sorpresa de Eminem con \"Lose Yourself\", de la película 8 Mile (2002). La canción fue nominada y ganó el premio a la Mejor Canción Original en 2003, pero Eminem se negó a asistir a la ceremonia porque no confiaba en que la canción realmente fuera a ganar, entre otros factores. La idea de traer de vuelta a Eminem surgió de Mills y de la Academia, que querían mantener un número musical de \"alta energía\" en la línea de las actuaciones de apertura de Justin Timberlake y Queen + Adam Lambert en las ediciones de 2017 y 2019, respectivamente, además de encontrar una manera de darle a Eminem la oportunidad de interpretar su canción ganadora. Además, a Eminem el momento le resultó oportuno, ya que acababa de lanzar un nuevo álbum, Music to Be Murdered By. La actuación fue un secreto muy bien guardado por los productores de la ceremonia, y Eminem tendría la opción de abandonar el espectáculo si su participación en la premiación se descubría antes de que esta ocurriera; por eso, su actuación se programó a mitad de la ceremonia y no como número de apertura, para que, si desistía, no se interrumpiera el programa.","source":"YouTube: Canal <i>Mauser932</i>"}},{"type":"awards_nominees","name":"Mejor Canción Original","nominee_list":[{"type":"movie","id":504608,"name":"Rocketman","image_path":"/tCfzNtsMVGYVJNsAEgVCBmuXHYF.jpg","director":"(I'm Gonna) Love Me Again","winner":true},{"type":"movie","id":301528,"name":"Toy Story 4","image_path":"/AkrRD3Lnwb82Stu2SpDKAerK6O2.jpg","director":"I Can't Let You Throw Yourself Away","winner":false},{"type":"movie","id":506528,"name":"Harriet, en busca de la libertad","image_path":"/wFfn2PISJ8u4Ui45kIY6vASEHjq.jpg","director":"Stand Up","winner":false},{"type":"movie","id":514439,"name":"Un amor inquebrantable","image_path":"/qNrL1DAHxLA5Bh5sc2xMWJ1pHa8.jpg","director":"I'm Standing With You","winner":false},{"type":"movie","id":330457,"name":"Frozen 2","image_path":"/g6n7TdQSgozArIM0okXTjjCM9Np.jpg","director":"Into The Unknown","winner":false}]},{"type":"awards_nominees","name":"Mejor Diseño de Producción","nominee_list":[{"type":"movie","id":466272,"name":"Había una vez en Hollywood","image_path":"/gMEKjlq4JcLR93oAVSD47MSeO9h.jpg","director":"Quentin Tarantino","winner":true},{"type":"movie","id":496243,"name":"Parásitos","image_path":"/igw938inb6Fy0YVcwIyxQ7Lu5FO.jpg","director":"Bong Joon-ho","winner":false},{"type":"movie","id":398978,"name":"El irlandés","image_path":"/mFyQRQoUh8InlwmE5fRd9LOBRZ1.jpg","director":"Martin Scorsese","winner":false},{"type":"movie","id":515001,"name":"Jojo Rabbit","image_path":"/vC7gB8h8KFTsraAoKsj0haHAljR.jpg","director":"Taika Waititi","winner":false},{"type":"movie","id":530915,"name":"1917","image_path":"/8KkyXE7Hd9MPOOkORxkMM6SUXAB.jpg","director":"